          "story": "Nari was my father's name for my mother, Narges, the love of his life and the subject of much of his poetry.\n\nThe track brings together his spoken poetry and singing in Baluchi, drawn from interviews and recordings he sent me while I was studying music in 2024. In these words, he calls her to come to him, to hold her in his eyes.",
